<title>Iraq: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/iraq/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-iraq-2026-11-08T23:50:40.077Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sun, 08 Nov 2026 23:50:40 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Drone strikes attributed to Iran have halted production at the Khor Mor gas field in Iraqi Kurdistan, cutting power output by about 2.8 gigawatts and disrupting electricity supplies in the north. Iraqi officials have asked Iran to close most border crossings, while the foreign minister is discussing militia weapons regulation with Tehran and regional security arrangements free of outside interference. Flooding in Erbil and Kirkuk has caused deaths and missing persons, and protests have blocked the Mosul-Erbil road in the Nineveh Plains, while smuggling of petroleum products was foiled in Diyala and Nineveh. The UCDP recorded 396 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMixwFBVV95cUxOSjc4dFNBUmN3UHp3Uk5FLUhNOElWeTVLRDNzSHZsSTAyUWZ4elN0eHdYUVJ5MDZBb0Y3MDNaNzlWbTRHMnctUFY5dGdNWWtKUnZTdHRPeXl1UUhlUE9mdTU0d2ZWTk9Hak9HaHVXaVBJQ3BoVXdfZnFxelF2aUc1MEV1U0JFQ1lDQ0s3RXhtRnk2dmoxZ2h4a3FRazE4Y3VpbGlDYW1zdE1DcDYxU3R4aE9zOWxkdTNuRVFxMzRlTDEtMDNHRmpr?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMixAFBVV95cUxOaVVxWlAwOFI0ZGd4TUdTNFozbzE5TXN5UGx3R0NnX0JRdExfcVhSb21iYklFOXJ2QUpncXdoSFB3eE1NS0FFeHljZXQxeWlEVTNKVWd1eFVLWTZmbVpsSUs5Q3NqNUk2b1JYQVNxSFIyTTMxZERFdDBWVUFfUFZ2MkFtOUlIYm5VbE9kQ2kzVmdUTV9pZHFxNWNvUVFhYkI1WHc5LTZSS0JMR1Nka3gwSjgzWWFZZXN6OFFTRHB5Rzk1THIz?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.aljazeera.com/news/2026/11/8/could-iraqs-kurdish-region-return-to-two-separate-administrations&quot;&gt;aljazeera.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Chosunbiz&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Gulf News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;South China Morning Post&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/r